# A checkout of the-cascade-protocol/spec as the engine command is given one,
# holding the one vocabulary the tiny adapter is read against.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix ex:  <urn:example:catalog#> .

<urn:example:catalog#> a owl:Ontology .

ex:Item a owl:Class .
ex:Shelf a owl:Class .

ex:title a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:code a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:shelf a owl:ObjectProperty .
